⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Green Wall
node WE1 · WE1 · ⟦The Green Wall:WE1:63e546⟧

WHO   — The Green Wall — the boundary of the wild
WHAT  — The line between the engineered and the living: beyond it are the Mephi, descendants of those who stayed free.
WHERE — WE1 · WE  Framework inputs: We (Yevgeny Zamyatin, 1924)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because a perfected order must wall out the wild — the warning lives in what it must keep outside to survive.
HOW   — By an impassable glass-and-electric barrier between the city and the forest.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I keep the wild out and the numbers in — and everything the One State calls a disease, a soul, a freedom, lives on my other side.

